# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal configuration -- contains the user's API key in plain text.
# A template (chat-config.example.json) is committed instead; the app
# creates the real file automatically on first run.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
chat-config.json
pet-config.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime data -- chat history, long-term memory, usage stats and logs.
# These are personal and must never be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
history.json
user_memory.json
usage.json
pet.log
pet.log.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Assets
#
# Only the original factory sprite (phoebe.png / phoebe@2x.png) and the single
# "菲比啾比" sound ship with the repo. Extra artwork and the larger sound pack
# are personal assets (AI-generated art, recorded audio) that were not cleared
# for redistribution, so they stay local.
#
# The folders themselves are kept (see Art/.gitkeep, Sounds/.gitkeep) so the
# app's scanning code still has somewhere to look.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Art/*
!Art/.gitkeep
Sounds/*/*
!Sounds/菲比啾比/
Sounds/菲比啾比/*
!Sounds/菲比啾比/菲比啾比.mp3

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Development leftovers
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_backup/
*.webp
*-preview.png
geometry-baseline.txt
source-original.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
#
# The pattern is deliberately broad ("*.dll" plus "*.exe") rather than just
# naming PhoebePet.dll. Reason: the apphost/csc steps have left stray copies
# in this folder with a GUID prefix (e.g.
# 1bc1e633-...._PhoebePet.dll), which a name-exact rule does not catch.
# Nothing here needs to be committed -- build.ps1 regenerates all of it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
PhoebePet.runtimeconfig.json
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.rsp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vs/
.vscode/
*.swp
